#: ../../source/best-practices_proxy.md:8
msgid ""
"The proxy url should be passed to the `Client` or `Pool` constructor, "
"while the upstream server url should be added to every request call in "
"the `path`. For instance, if you need to send a request to the `/hello` "
"route of your upstream server, the `path` should be `path: "
"'http://upstream.server:port/hello?foo=bar'`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/best-practices_proxy.md:13
msgid ""
